customer: office_girl
problem: inverted_colors
brief:
	The Young entrepreneur pranked her: High Contrast Black. Their emails go back and forth about it; nothing leads the player there.

== drop-off
(neutral) Hey mr IT-guy! Nick from work recommended this place. I have NO IDEA what happened but I need URGENT help!
- Welcome to Compufun! I'll do my best to help. Tell me more.
	(problem) The colors are all messed up! Open it and see for yourself!
- ... that's pretty evident.
	(angry) Hey! I don't need your sarcasm! I swear! I just opened my computer and it was like this!!

- What do you mean?
	(irritated02) It's my work computer! All the colours have changed! Everything is all black and tacky looking. I can't work like this!
	- This machine is from your workplace? Are you the only one using this computer?
		(neutral) It's only me! I worry about people accessing my files, so Nick helped me set up the computer all safe-like!
		- I think I know what might be up... Just leave it with me.
	- I feel you girl!
	- I'll take a look. I'm sure this is nothing critical.
	(happy) I'm so relieved.
	(problem) Nick said he thought it was something about my OS version maybe?
	(happy) Of course: he isn't a computer WIZ like you, so what does he know! At least coming here was good advice!
	- You're in safe hands miss. I'll call you when you can come and pick it up! Have a Funtastic day!

== pick-up
(neutral) Hey mr IT-guy! You already figured out why my computer suddenly became so awful looking?
- It was an easy fix. All is back to normal. Nothing to worry about.
	(happy) I'm so happy! Thanks mr IT-guy! You're the best!
	- Thanks... I guess... Have a Funtastic day!
- Looks like someone set you up for a little prank. Did you perhaps leave your computer unlocked and unattended?
	(thinking) Hmm. Not that I can think of. I mean, it was just me and Nick in the office this week.
	- ...
		(happy) Well then! I'll be on my way! Buh-bye mr IT-guy!
		- Have a... Funtastic day...
